{
  "title": "Cancel DoorDash DashPass and Request Refund for Unused Time",
  "content": "This plan handles the DashPass cancellation and refund request as a single browser session. Since cancelling a subscription and requesting a refund involves a stateful login session (authentication → navigation → cancellation → refund request/chat with support), this must be done in one browser agent call. We'll also prepare a fallback approach in parallel by looking up DoorDash's customer support phone number, in case the in-app cancellation doesn't offer a refund option.\n\n**Key considerations:**\n- The subscription is active until September 15, 2024 (note: this date is in the past relative to current time Feb 2026, so the subscription may have already renewed or lapsed)\n- User wants refund to original payment method\n- DoorDash may not offer pro-rated refunds automatically; contacting support may be necessary\n- The browser agent will attempt the full flow: log in → cancel DashPass → request refund or initiate support chat",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "goal": "Search for the most current DoorDash DashPass cancellation and refund process, including customer support contact options (phone number, live chat URL) and any known tricks for getting a pro-rated refund for unused subscription time. Note that the user's subscription was from Sept 2024 and current date is Feb 2026.",
      "tool_name": "web_search",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Fetch the official DoorDash help page for DashPass cancellation to get the exact current steps and any refund policy details: https://help.doordash.com/consumers/s/article/How-do-I-cancel-my-Dashpass-subscription?language=en_US",
      "tool_name": "web_fetch",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Based on the research results from tasks 0 and 1, synthesize the best approach for cancelling DashPass and obtaining a refund. Determine: (1) Whether to attempt self-service cancellation via the website/app first, (2) Whether to go directly to customer support chat/phone, (3) What arguments to make for the pro-rated refund, (4) Note that the subscription date (Sept 2024) is ~17 months ago from current date (Feb 2026) - the subscription may have auto-renewed multiple times. Prepare clear instructions for the browser agent.",
      "tool_name": "reasoning",
      "depends_on": [0, 1]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Log into DoorDash (user will provide credentials when prompted), navigate to DashPass subscription settings, cancel the DashPass subscription, and request a refund for unused time. Full flow in one session: (1) Go to doordash.com and log in, (2) Navigate to Account → Manage DashPass or DashPass settings, (3) Click Cancel/End subscription, (4) If a refund option appears, select refund to original payment method, (5) If no automatic refund option, initiate a live chat or support request from within the account to request a pro-rated refund for the unused portion of the current billing cycle, citing the subscription renewal date. Screenshot all confirmation pages. If the cancellation option is hidden, try navigating directly to https://www.doordash.com/consumer/more/ or the account settings page.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_browser_agent",
      "depends_on": [2]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Synthesize the final outcome. Report to the user: (1) Whether DashPass was successfully cancelled, (2) Whether a refund was processed or requested, (3) Expected refund amount and timeline, (4) Any confirmation numbers or screenshots, (5) If the browser cancellation failed or no refund was offered, provide the DoorDash support phone number and a script for calling to request the refund, along with next steps.",
      "tool_name": "reasoning",
      "depends_on": [3]
    }
  ],
